      "title": "Rate Calculation & Caching",
      "items": [
        "Pincode serviceability & rates cached via MD5 fingerprint (pickup + delivery + weight + COD)",
        "RateService optimizes courier selection using LOWEST_COST or FASTEST_DELIVERY strategies",
        "Admin kill-switch allows immediate global shipping pause or individual courier disabling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Non-Blocking Async Dispatch",
      "items": [
        "Order checkout creates a PENDING shipment instantly in MongoDB without calling external courier APIs",
        "BullMQ background queue worker asynchronously generates AWBs, labels, and schedules pickups",
        "Customer checkout never freezes or times out due to slow external courier servers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Normalized Multi-Carrier Factory",
      "items": [
        "ShiprocketProvider, DelhiveryProvider, and XpressbeesProvider adhere to strict ShippingProvider interface",
        "WebhookParser standardizes inconsistent tracking webhooks into unified Order Tracking timeline",
